OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm
OL,6,Fevening with plenty of sunshine. It
OL,7,Fwill remain dry overnight with plenty
OL,8,Fof clear periods. Light winds expected
OL,9,Fthroughout and a touch warmer than
OL,10,Frecent nights.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA dry and bright start to the
OL,13,Fday but cloud soon thickening from the
OL,14,Fnorth with the odd spot of light rain
OL,15,Fpossible. Breezy at times during the
OL,16,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
