OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA dry
OL,6,Fand bright start to Monday with some
OL,7,Fpatchy cloud around at first, this
OL,8,Fcontinues into Tuesday and Wednesday,
OL,9,Fwith plenty lengthy sunshine.
OL,10,FPotentially turning hot by Wednesday.
